## Tasks

| Command | Action |
|---|---|
| `/android-cli` | Health check — installed version, `ANDROID_HOME`, project describe |
| `/android-cli install` | Install or upgrade Android CLI + verify environment |
| `/android-cli skills` | List, add, or remove official Android Skills |
| `/android-cli describe` | Generate a structured project metadata payload for grounding |
| `/android-cli journeys` | Author, list, or run natural-language UX journeys |
| `/android-cli build [--variant]` | Run a build through the CLI (delegates to Gradle) |
| `/android-cli docs <query>` | Fetch official Android documentation by query |
| `/android-cli emulator <subcommand>` | Create, start, list, or stop emulators |

