## Checklist

- [ ] `android --version` reports 1.0+ on every developer machine and in CI
- [ ] `ANDROID_HOME` and `ANDROID_AGENT` set in shell profile and CI env
- [ ] `android describe --format json` runs in under 5 seconds against this project
- [ ] At least one official Google skill installed via `android skills add` and committed
- [ ] `.claude/settings.json` has a SessionStart hook calling `android describe`
- [ ] At least one journey under `android/journeys/` covers a critical smoke flow
- [ ] CI runs `android build`, `android test`, and `android journeys run --tag smoke`
- [ ] No raw `./gradlew` invocations in agent prompts where `android build` would do
- [ ] `android skills list --installed` matches what's checked into the repo

