## Health Check Output Format

```
## Android CLI Health Report
**Project:** <name>
**Date:** <today>
**Agent:** ${ANDROID_AGENT:-unset}

### Critical 🔴
- Android CLI not installed — run `npm install -g @android/cli`
- ANDROID_HOME not set — agent hooks calling `android describe` will fail silently

### Warnings 🟠
- No SessionStart hook configured in .claude/settings.json — agent sessions start ungrounded
- Skill `r8-analyzer` not installed — release builds risk unsafe keep rules
- No journeys tagged `smoke` — CI has no end-to-end signal

### Opportunities 🟡
- `adaptive-ui` skill recommended — project has tablet variants in flavors
- `perfetto-analysis` skill recommended — baseline-profile workflow already in place
- `android describe` output is 18 KB — consider trimming unused modules from the workspace

### Good ✅
- Android CLI 1.0.0 installed and on PATH
- 6 official skills installed and committed
- SessionStart hook wired in .claude/settings.json
- 4 journeys present, all green in last CI run
- CI pipeline uses `android build`, `android test`, and `android journeys run`
```
